<!-- ===================================================== -->

<section id="determinant">

<h2>5. Determinants</h2>


<h3>5.1 Determinant kya hota hai?</h3>

<div class="definition">

Determinant ek scalar numerical value hai jo
square matrix se calculate hoti hai.

</div>

<p>
Determinant sirf square matrices ke liye define hota hai.
</p>


<h3>5.2 2×2 Matrix ka determinant</h3>

<p>
Agar:
</p>

<div class="matrix">

A =

[ a  b ]
[ c  d ]

</div>

<p>
to:
</p>

<div class="formula">

|A| = ad - bc

</div>


<h3>5.3 Example</h3>

<div class="matrix">

A =

[ 3  4 ]
[ 2  5 ]

</div>

<p>
Formula:
</p>

<div class="formula">

|A| = ad - bc

</div>

<p>
So:
</p>

<div class="formula">

= (3×5) - (4×2)

<br><br>

= 15 - 8

<br><br>

= 7

</div>


<h3>5.4 Determinant ka importance</h3>

<p>
Determinant ka use:
</p>

<ul>

<li>Matrix invertible hai ya nahi check karne mein</li>

<li>Linear equations solve karne mein</li>

<li>Area/volume calculations</li>

<li>Computer graphics</li>

<li>Linear transformations</li>

<li>Numerical computing</li>

</ul>


<div class="important">

Agar:

<br><br>

det(A) ≠ 0

<br><br>

to A ka inverse exist karta hai.

<br><br>

Agar:

<br><br>

det(A) = 0

<br><br>

to A singular matrix hai aur ordinary inverse exist nahi karta.

</div>


<h3>5.5 3×3 Determinant</h3>

<p>
Suppose:
</p>

<div class="matrix">

A =

[ a  b  c ]
[ d  e  f ]
[ g  h  i ]

</div>

<p>
Determinant:
</p>

<div class="formula">

|A|

=

a(ei - fh)
-
b(di - fg)
+
c(dh - eg)

</div>


<h3>5.6 3×3 Example</h3>

<div class="matrix">

A =

[ 1  2  3 ]
[ 0  4  5 ]
[ 1  0  6 ]

</div>

<p>
Formula:
</p>

<div class="formula">

|A|
=
1(4×6 - 5×0)
-
2(0×6 - 5×1)
+
3(0×0 - 4×1)

</div>

<p>
Calculate:
</p>

<div class="formula">

= 1(24)

- 2(-5)

+ 3(-4)

<br><br>

= 24 + 10 - 12

<br><br>

= 22

</div>


<h3>5.7 Determinant aur Area</h3>

<p>
2D geometry mein determinant transformation ke area scaling factor ko represent kar sakta hai.
</p>

<div class="example">

Agar transformation matrix ka determinant:

det(A) = 2

<br><br>

to area approximately 2 times scale ho sakta hai.

</div>

</section>


