<p>

Agar kisi square matrix ka <b>Determinant</b> non-zero hai,
to uska <b>Inverse</b> exist kar sakta hai.

</p>

<p>

Inverse ki help se <b>Simultaneous Linear Equations</b>
solve kar sakte ho.

</p>

<p>

Aur yehi mathematics aage jaakar
<b>Computer Graphics, Image Processing, Machine Learning,
AI, Computer Vision, Robotics aur Data Science</b>
mein use hoti hai.

</p>

